OL,3,GNEWSA'Despicable' thief steals ring
OL,4,Afrom dead priest's finger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA funeral director worker has admitted
OL,7,Fstealing a gold ring from a dead
OL,8,Fpriest's finger.
OL,10,FNicholas Mather prised the 18-carat
OL,11,Fgold priesthood ring from the hand of
OL,12,Fthe late Father Peter Crowther on 8
OL,13,FMarch in Chorley, Lancashire,
OL,14,Fmagistrates heard.
OL,16,FCrowther's parents had bought the ring
OL,17,Fin Rome when he was ordained in 1971.
OL,18,FHis dying wish was to be buried with
OL,19,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
