OL,3,GNEWSA'Despicable' thief steals ring
OL,4,Afrom dead priest's finger
OL,5,
OL,6,FMather pleaded guilty to two counts of
OL,7,Ftheft at Preston Magistrates Court. A
OL,8,Frelative said the 34-year-old was
OL,9,F"utterly despicable".
